//! ML-DSA
//!
//! ML-DSA is a post-quantum key signature scheme, specified in
//! [FIPS 204](https://csrc.nist.gov/pubs/fips/204/final).
//!
//! ```
//! use bssl_crypto::mldsa;
//!
//! // Generate a key pair.
